&lt;li&gt;2+ years of SaaS experience selling similar products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience meeting and exceeding quota in a closing role, with a track record of selling SaaS or DBaaS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience, passion and success in outbound prospecting&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong sales acumen and a general interest in the businesses you work with&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
